27. Generate Sequence of Dates

2025-01-01 to 2025-01-10

PySpark:

from pyspark.sql.functions import sequence,explode

spark.range(1).select(
explode(
sequence(
to_date(lit("2025-01-01")),
to_date(lit("2025-01-10"))
)
).alias("date")
)

SQL:

SELECT generate_series(
DATE '2025-01-01',
DATE '2025-01-10',
INTERVAL '1 day'
);
